  "evidences": [
    {
      "id": "ev_1",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Intezer_Lazarus-Cryptocurrency-Exchanges-FinTech-Companies(03-28-2018)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s1"
      },
      "text": "intezer.com /lazarus-group-targets-more-cryptocurrency-exchanges-and-fintech-companies/ Blog Cybersecurity DNA Through our research, we came across a new malicious document where we have found changes and a continuation to their campaign targeting potential cryptocurrency exchanges, FinTech, financial companies, and others who might be involved with cryptocurrencies.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_2",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Intezer_Lazarus-Cryptocurrency-Exchanges-FinTech-Companies(03-28-2018)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s2"
      },
      "text": "Infection Vector The malicious document’s original creation name is “Investment Proposal.doc” and attempts to impersonate an employee of an Australia based law firm for commercial and financial services",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_5",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Intezer_Lazarus-Cryptocurrency-Exchanges-FinTech-Companies(03-28-2018)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 9,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p9_s1"
      },
      "text": "(embedded VBA macro) The embedded RAT is dropped to and executed from %USERPROFILE%\\RuntimeBroker.exe .",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_7",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Intezer_Lazarus-Cryptocurrency-Exchanges-FinTech-Companies(03-28-2018)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 9,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p9_s3"
      },
      "text": "After uploading the RAT to Intezer Analyze™, we found 4% of the code to have been used in previous malware attributed to the Lazarus group, but 85% of the code base is completely unique.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_15",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Intezer_Lazarus-Cryptocurrency-Exchanges-FinTech-Companies(03-28-2018)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 13,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p13_s2"
      },
      "text": "Command ID Functionality 0xF4004A Execute cmd.exe and output results to temp file or retrieve CD via GetCurrentDirectoryW .",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_26",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Intezer_Lazarus-Cryptocurrency-Exchanges-FinTech-Companies(03-28-2018)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 17,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p17_s1"
      },
      "text": "END RSA PRIVATE KEY----- Conclusion As we can see, the Blockbuster campaign and the Lazarus group are still active and have shown a continued interest in cryptocurrencies and companies surrounding cryptocurrency.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_27",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Intezer_Lazarus-Cryptocurrency-Exchanges-FinTech-Companies(03-28-2018)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 17,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p17_s2"
      },
      "text": "Numerous exchanges are believed to have been hacked by the Lazarus group and there has been a significant amount of money stolen by doing so.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
